Package: pingpong-net
Version: @VERSION@
Section: games
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Maintainer: Pingpong Net <root@localhost>
Description: terminal ping pong over the internet (client and lobby server)
 Play ping pong against people on other networks. One machine runs the
 lobby and match server ("pingpong server"); players run "pingpong" to host,
 find and join matches. Extra players wait in a queue and the loser of each
 game rotates to the back of it.
 .
 The binary is statically linked and has no dependencies. A systemd unit
 (pingpong-server.service) is installed but not enabled.
